    <mxCell id="fb_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;SHALLOW &quot;HUMAN ERROR&quot; RCA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Repeats Next Month&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Closing Postmortems With &amp;ldquo;Model Hallucinated — Fixed Prompt&amp;rdquo;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Every major AI incident requires &lt;b&gt;multiple missing guardrails&lt;/b&gt; (no schema + no loop cap + no budget fuse) to align.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;100% Repeat Outage Risk&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
